<span style="font-size:12px; line-height:20.7999992370605px"><strong>International Applicants</strong></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11px"><span style="line-height:20.8px">If you are from a country whose native language is not English, you must provide proof of English proficiency:</span></span>

<ul style="line-height: 20.7999992370605px;">
	<li><span style="font-size:11px">TOEFL score of at least 550 (PBT) or 80 (iBT)</span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11px">IELTS overall band score of at least 6.5 with no band below 6.0</span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11px">Pearson Test of English (PTE) score of at least 60</span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:11px"> <span style="line-height:20.8px">It is&nbsp;</span><em style="font-size:12px; line-height:20.7999992370605px">strongly recommended</em><span style="line-height:20.8px">&nbsp; to complete and pass the English proficiency exam prior to beginning the application process. Scores will be accepted for exams taken up to two years prior to your first semester.</span><br style="line-height: 20.7999992370605px; font-size: 12px;" />
<strong style="font-size:12px; line-height:20.7999992370605px">Applications submitted without a passing TOEFL, IELTS, or PTE score will not be considered</strong><span style="line-height:20.8px">.&nbsp;</span></span>				

